			title: "One Family at a Time"
			description: ["Steel grades, stainless alloys, superconductors, refractory alloys, ceramics and high-pressure carbon will become separate production families. A family leaves quarantine only when the pack has both a physically meaningful recipe route and a correctly placed Main Program milestone."]
